  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">‘물질의 특성’ 단원 마무리 겸 과학실에서 할로윈데이 행사를 준비했습니다!<br>할로윈이라고 그냥 놀 수는 없어서 어떻게든 과학과 연결해서 할로윈 느낌 내기^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a02e78da1bac5f2e94337fbbbd10c38ea047ab2b_re_1667997886743\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a02e78da1bac5f2e94337fbbbd10c38ea047ab2b_re_1667997886743\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"268\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb023b9950aaee9467b1d75ae6a6993fbfa7d942_re_1667997886743\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb023b9950aaee9467b1d75ae6a6993fbfa7d942_re_1667997886743\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"268\"><div class=\"figcaption\">미션 쿠폰</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">세 가지 미션을 주고 두 가지 이상 성공하면 뽑기를 해 할로윈 간식 등 선물을 줬고<br>각 미션은 부스 형식으로 운영, 부스별로 한명씩 운영자를 뽑아 직접 행사를 운영하도록 했습니다 ㅎㅎ<br><br>부스 운영자들과 미리 예비실험을 했지만 당일날 분명 또 까먹을 것 같아 부스 책상마다 실험 방법을 붙이고,<br>혼란스럽지 않게 한번에 최대 3명씩만 받아 운영했습니다 ~!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e3b29439defa70c372227f59606a93f707fe894_re_1667997886744\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e3b29439defa70c372227f59606a93f707fe894_re_1667997886744\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/34b331f67e53efb9c53599beeab6288dcc07caa9_re_1667997886744\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/34b331f67e53efb9c53599beeab6288dcc07caa9_re_1667997886744\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da98ca7e33507c712eff342e4d47921a96a6dbb3_re_1667997886744\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da98ca7e33507c712eff342e4d47921a96a6dbb3_re_1667997886744\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">첫 번째 미션: 할로윈 느낌의 색소를 섞어 밀도탑 만들기&#127777;&#65039;&#129514;<br>가장 시간이 많이 소요되는 미션이었습니다<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24ad2579828763859a7db8208e8acde19459e618_re_1667997886745\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24ad2579828763859a7db8208e8acde19459e618_re_1667997886745\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c3e93fa38e6e2b90d1d4678656eea023d6e4c0d_re_1667997886745\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c3e93fa38e6e2b90d1d4678656eea023d6e4c0d_re_1667997886745\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvh9hhtflamep4i6c7d32mekm@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1080\" data-video-height=\"1920\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvh9hhtflamep4i6c7d32mekm/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33224906552&amp;signature=sS304a2WHWZ96I9BpD6fbChHTVU%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1080\" data-video-origin-height=\"1920\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvh9hhtflamep4i6c7d32mekm?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aDloaHRmbGFtZXA0aTZjN2QzMm1la20iLCJ0aWQiOiJkNmQyMDUxMi02YTdkLTRjOTEtYTFlNC05NWI4OWFkNjYxY2YiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODM2OTl9.DEihw6yQpNrh7AW_afXUh2hLqMsVpWIeClUuXTEf3PxqMAJIROr6QgidYo5E4ER9hc5f1rSMtds-ibQITSeC5w&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">두 번째 미션: 끓는 피 만들기&#129656;<br>학생들이 가장 신기해하고 재밌어하는 미션이었습니다<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/733f6c1fa91d4f0f8aa8436fe00ab471352d05ce_re_1667997886745\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/733f6c1fa91d4f0f8aa8436fe00ab471352d05ce_re_1667997886745\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/851ea2fa78c9678f9deb28aa92b18a93408558c5_re_1667997886745\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/851ea2fa78c9678f9deb28aa92b18a93408558c5_re_1667997886745\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5af0d23944a547e85bbc90bc9ceb0a0b60f6faa8_re_1667997886745\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5af0d23944a547e85bbc90bc9ceb0a0b60f6faa8_re_1667997886745\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">세 번째 미션: 크로마토그래피 유령만들기&#128123;<br>애들이 너무 대충해서 금방 끝났던 미션 ㅎㅎ,, 작품은 한 곳에 걸어두었습니다<br><br>+)원래 학생들과 포토존도 준비했는데 이태원 사고로 인해 급하게 정리하고, 준비했던 실험만 진행했습니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28ee0e5ad154f9e70e91e81f1ca1257b975515c2_re_1667997886745\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28ee0e5ad154f9e70e91e81f1ca1257b975515c2_re_1667997886745\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"><div class=\"figcaption\">할로윈이라고 5단원 심장 모세혈관 폐를 그려준 멋진 학생 !</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/73f64781064e4b79f1098cd7fb5850351a06666e_re_1667997886746\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/73f64781064e4b79f1098cd7fb5850351a06666e_re_1667997886746\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>+)부스 운영이다보니 과학에 흥미없는 학생들이 통제가 안되고 과학실에서 위험한 물품을 건드릴까봐<br>따로 쉬는 부스를 하나 만들어 노래를 틀어주고, 미로찾기나 숨은 그림찾기 등 프린트를 뽑아줬더니 얌전히 있었습니다^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1949a041dd72c6fa18f25c5dcf1ee3e0046ef9ba_re_1667997886746\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1949a041dd72c6fa18f25c5dcf1ee3e0046ef9ba_re_1667997886746\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"272\"><div class=\"figcaption\">행사구조도</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>+)초대장도 보내고 사실 누구보다 할로윈에 진심이었던 쌤..&#128514;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ac6faeeb951b1da3e539cbd25062fb17cdd67fe_re_1667997886746\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ac6faeeb951b1da3e539cbd25062fb17cdd67fe_re_1667997886746\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"270\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ef9260e6cd172afb3bee4b3ddaf7aaa3c5009bc_re_1667997886746\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5ef9260e6cd172afb3bee4b3ddaf7aaa3c5009bc_re_1667997886746\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>필요하신 분들 사용하시라고 미리캔버스 ppt 링크 첨부합니다. 비밀번호는 1031입니다^^</p><p><a href=\"https://www.miricanvas.com/v/11eiuyn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.miricanvas.com/v/11eiuyn</a></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
